#: conf.json:summary
msgid "Marks the place of an error under a rendered sequence (command-line arguments, tokens or a string) and prints it with a message."
msgstr "在渲染出的序列（命令行参数、词法单元或字符串）下面标出错误所在的位置，并连同错误信息一起输出。"

#: manual/api/core.md:1
msgid "core API"
msgstr "core API"

#: manual/api/core.md:5
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "用途"

#: manual/api/core.md:7
msgid "The root package of `KCN-judu/err_marker` turns a sequence, a position and a message into a three-line error report: the rendered sequence, a marker line under the position, and the message. Its public surface is recorded in `src/pkg.generated.mbti`; how the marker column is computed, and where that computation is wrong in 0.1, is explained in the [design](../design/core.md)."
msgstr "`KCN-judu/err_marker` 的根包把一个序列、一个位置和一条信息变成三行错误报告：渲染出的序列、位置下方的标记行，以及错误信息。其公开接口记录在 `src/pkg.generated.mbti` 中；标记列是如何计算的、这个计算在 0.1 中哪里有错，见[设计](../design/core.md)。"

#: manual/api/core.md:13
msgid "Importing"
msgstr "导入"

#: manual/api/core.md:15
msgid "Add the package to your `moon.pkg`:"
msgstr "在你的 `moon.pkg` 中加入这个包："

#: manual/api/core.md:23
msgid "The examples on this page call it as `@err_marker`."
msgstr "本页的示例以 `@err_marker` 调用它。"

#: manual/api/core.md:25
msgid "Sequences"
msgstr "序列"

#: manual/api/core.md:29
msgid "The text that an error is marked in: an array of elements joined by a separator, or a string."
msgstr "错误被标记在其中的文本：用分隔符连接起来的元素数组，或一个字符串。"

#: manual/api/core.md:36
msgid "The type is abstract; build values with `Sequence::from_array` or `Sequence::from_string`. The type parameter is the element type, which must implement `Show` when the sequence is rendered by `ErrorData::mark`."
msgstr "这是抽象类型；用 `Sequence::from_array` 或 `Sequence::from_string` 构造值。类型参数是元素类型；序列由 `ErrorData::mark` 渲染时，元素类型必须实现 `Show`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:42
msgid "Builds a sequence from an array whose elements are rendered with `Show` and joined by `join`."
msgstr "从数组构造序列，元素用 `Show` 渲染，并用 `join` 连接。"

#: manual/api/core.md:49
msgid "`join` defaults to a single space. Positions in this sequence are element indices: position `i` covers the rendered text of element `i`. Elements are not quoted, so an element that is empty or contains the separator cannot be told apart from its neighbours ([#11](https://github.com/moonbit-community/err_marker/issues/11))."
msgstr "`join` 默认是一个空格。这种序列中的位置是元素下标：位置 `i` 覆盖元素 `i` 渲染出的文本。元素不加引号，所以空元素或含有分隔符的元素无法与相邻元素区分开（[#11](https://github.com/moonbit-community/err_marker/issues/11)）。"

#: manual/api/core.md:72
msgid "Builds a sequence from a string."
msgstr "从字符串构造序列。"

#: manual/api/core.md:78
msgid "Positions in this sequence are UTF-16 code-unit offsets into the string, which equal character indices only for text in the Basic Multilingual Plane ([#7](https://github.com/moonbit-community/err_marker/issues/7))."
msgstr "这种序列中的位置是字符串中的 UTF-16 码元偏移，只有对基本多文种平面内的文本才等于字符下标（[#7](https://github.com/moonbit-community/err_marker/issues/7)）。"

#: manual/api/core.md:97
msgid "Error data"
msgstr "错误数据"

#: manual/api/core.md:101
msgid "What went wrong and where: an optional error type, a message, a start position and an offset."
msgstr "出了什么错、错在哪里：可选的错误类型、一条信息、起始位置和偏移量。"

#: manual/api/core.md:113
msgid "The marked span is `err_pos` through `err_pos + err_offset`, both ends included, in the units of the sequence it is marked in. The fields are readable from outside the package; build values with `ErrorData::make`."
msgstr "被标记的范围是从 `err_pos` 到 `err_pos + err_offset`，两端都包含，单位与所标记的序列一致。字段可以在包外读取；用 `ErrorData::make` 构造值。"

#: manual/api/core.md:119
msgid "Builds an `ErrorData` from a message and optional type, position and offset."
msgstr "由一条信息以及可选的类型、位置和偏移量构造 `ErrorData`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:125
msgid "The defaults are `err_type = None`, `err_pos = -1` and `err_offset = 0`. A negative `err_pos` means \"no position\": `mark` then prints an empty marker line. `make` never fails; positions are only checked when the error is marked."
msgstr "默认值为 `err_type = None`、`err_pos = -1` 和 `err_offset = 0`。负的 `err_pos` 表示“没有位置”：此时 `mark` 输出一个空的标记行。`make` 不会失败；位置只在标记错误时才检查。"

#: manual/api/core.md:140
msgid "Rendering"
msgstr "渲染"

#: manual/api/core.md:144
msgid "Renders the sequence, a marker line under the span, and the formatted message, separated by newlines."
msgstr "渲染序列、范围下方的标记行以及格式化后的信息，三者之间用换行分隔。"

#: manual/api/core.md:151
msgid "`marker` is the character repeated under the span; it defaults to `^`."
msgstr "`marker` 是在范围下方重复的字符，默认为 `^`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:152
msgid "`gen_msg` formats the last line from `err_type` and `err_msg`. The default prints `Error(type): message`, or `Error: message` when `err_type` is `None`."
msgstr "`gen_msg` 由 `err_type` 和 `err_msg` 生成最后一行。默认输出 `Error(type): message`；`err_type` 为 `None` 时输出 `Error: message`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:155
msgid "If `err_pos` is negative, the marker line is empty. A negative `err_offset` counts as 0. A span that runs past the end is clamped to the last element or character. A start at or past the end marks the point just after the text with one marker character, which is how a missing argument is shown ([#10](https://github.com/moonbit-community/err_marker/issues/10))."
msgstr "如果 `err_pos` 为负，标记行为空。负的 `err_offset` 按 0 处理。超出末尾的范围会被截断到最后一个元素或字符。起点位于末尾或超出末尾时，用一个标记字符标出文本之后的那个位置，缺少参数时就这样表示（[#10](https://github.com/moonbit-community/err_marker/issues/10)）。"

#: manual/api/core.md:160
msgid "The marker column counts UTF-16 code units, not terminal columns, so it is only correct for ASCII-width text without newlines ([#6](https://github.com/moonbit-community/err_marker/issues/6), [#9](https://github.com/moonbit-community/err_marker/issues/9))."
msgstr "标记列按 UTF-16 码元计数，而不是按终端列数计数，所以只有对不含换行、宽度与 ASCII 相同的文本才正确（[#6](https://github.com/moonbit-community/err_marker/issues/6)、[#9](https://github.com/moonbit-community/err_marker/issues/9)）。"

#: manual/api/core.md:163
msgid "Tabs before the span are copied into the marker line, so the marker lines up whatever tab width the terminal uses; a tab inside the span still gets a single marker character ([#8](https://github.com/moonbit-community/err_marker/issues/8))."
msgstr "范围之前的 Tab 会被原样复制到标记行中，所以无论终端的 Tab 宽度是多少，标记都能对齐；范围内部的 Tab 仍然只对应一个标记字符（[#8](https://github.com/moonbit-community/err_marker/issues/8)）。"

#: manual/design/core.md:1
msgid "core design"
msgstr "core 设计"

#: manual/design/core.md:3
msgid "This page explains the model behind `err_marker` 0.1, how the marker line is computed, and where that model is wrong. The 0.2.0 model that replaces it is specified in [#5](https://github.com/moonbit-community/err_marker/issues/5)."
msgstr "本页说明 `err_marker` 0.1 背后的模型、标记行是如何计算的，以及这个模型哪里有错。取代它的 0.2.0 模型规定在 [#5](https://github.com/moonbit-community/err_marker/issues/5) 中。"

#: manual/design/core.md:7
msgid "The model"
msgstr "模型"

#: manual/design/core.md:9
msgid "A report has three lines: the rendered sequence $s$, a marker line, and the message. The marker line is $p$ padding characters followed by $w$ marker characters, so the whole design is the choice of $p$ (where the span starts) and $w$ (how wide it is). The padding is a space for each of the first $p$ code units of $s$, except that a tab is copied as a tab, so the marker lines up whatever tab width the terminal uses."
msgstr "一份报告有三行：渲染出的序列 $s$、标记行和错误信息。标记行是 $p$ 个填充字符后跟 $w$ 个标记字符，所以整个设计就是 $p$（范围从哪里开始）和 $w$（范围有多宽）的选择。填充对 $s$ 的前 $p$ 个码元各放一个空格，但 Tab 会原样复制为 Tab，所以无论终端的 Tab 宽度是多少，标记都能对齐。"

#: manual/design/core.md:16
msgid "Arrays"
msgstr "数组"

#: manual/design/core.md:18
msgid "For elements $x_0, \\dots, x_{n-1}$ rendered as strings $r_i = \\texttt{to\\_string}(x_i)$ and a separator of length $j$, the rendered text is"
msgstr "设元素 $x_0, \\dots, x_{n-1}$ 渲染为字符串 $r_i = \\texttt{to\\_string}(x_i)$，分隔符长度为 $j$，则渲染出的文本为"

#: manual/design/core.md:25
msgid "A span from element $a$ with offset $k$ covers elements $a$ to $a + k$, and"
msgstr "从元素 $a$ 开始、偏移量为 $k$ 的范围覆盖元素 $a$ 到 $a + k$，并且"

#: manual/design/core.md:32
msgid "where $|r|$ is `String::length`, the number of UTF-16 code units. If $a < 0$, nothing is drawn. A negative $k$ counts as $0$, and $a + k$ is clamped to $n - 1$. If $a \\ge n$, the mark is the point after the text: $p = |s|$ and $w = 1$."
msgstr "其中 $|r|$ 是 `String::length`，即 UTF-16 码元的个数。若 $a < 0$，什么都不画。负的 $k$ 按 $0$ 处理，$a + k$ 截断到 $n - 1$。若 $a \\ge n$，标出的是文本之后的那个位置：$p = |s|$，$w = 1$。"

#: manual/design/core.md:37
msgid "Strings"
msgstr "字符串"

#: manual/design/core.md:39
msgid "For a string, the span from $a$ with offset $k$ covers code units $a$ to $a + k$, so $p = a$ and $w = k + 1$. The same rules apply with $n = |s|$: $a + k$ is clamped to $n - 1$, and $a \\ge n$ gives the point $p = n$, $w = 1$."
msgstr "对字符串，从 $a$ 开始、偏移量为 $k$ 的范围覆盖码元 $a$ 到 $a + k$，所以 $p = a$，$w = k + 1$。同样的规则在 $n = |s|$ 时适用：$a + k$ 截断到 $n - 1$，$a \\ge n$ 给出位置 $p = n$，$w = 1$。"

#: manual/design/core.md:43
msgid "Where the model is wrong"
msgstr "模型哪里有错"

#: manual/design/core.md:45
msgid "The formulas measure length, but the reader sees columns. The two agree only when every code unit takes exactly one terminal column. Each known bug is a case where they disagree, or where the two sequence kinds disagree with each other:"
msgstr "公式量的是长度，读者看到的却是列。只有每个码元恰好占一个终端列时两者才一致。每个已知的 bug，要么是两者不一致的情形，要么是两种序列之间行为不一致的情形："

#: manual/design/core.md:50
msgid "Case"
msgstr "情形"

#: manual/design/core.md:50
msgid "What happens"
msgstr "发生了什么"

#: manual/design/core.md:50
msgid "Issue"
msgstr "Issue"

#: manual/design/core.md:52
msgid "Wide characters (CJK, emoji)"
msgstr "宽字符（中日韩文字、emoji）"

#: manual/design/core.md:52
msgid "one character is 2 columns but 1 or 2 code units; the marker drifts left"
msgstr "一个字符占 2 列，却是 1 或 2 个码元；标记向左偏"

#: manual/design/core.md:53
msgid "Surrogate pairs"
msgstr "代理对"

#: manual/design/core.md:53
msgid "positions are code units, so an odd offset splits a character"
msgstr "位置是码元，所以奇数偏移会把一个字符切开"

#: manual/design/core.md:54
msgid "Tabs inside the span"
msgstr "范围内部的 Tab"

#: manual/design/core.md:54
msgid "a tab gets one marker character although it moves to the next tab stop; tabs before the span are copied into the padding and no longer shift the marker"
msgstr "一个 Tab 会移到下一个制表位，却只对应一个标记字符；范围之前的 Tab 会被复制到填充中，不再使标记偏移"

#: manual/design/core.md:55
msgid "Newlines"
msgstr "换行"

#: manual/design/core.md:55
msgid "the marker is counted from the start of the text, not of its line"
msgstr "标记从整段文本的开头计数，而不是从所在行的开头"

#: manual/design/core.md:56
msgid "Separators inside elements, empty elements"
msgstr "元素内含分隔符、空元素"

#: manual/design/core.md:56
msgid "the joined text cannot be split back into elements"
msgstr "连接后的文本无法再拆回各个元素"

#: manual/design/core.md:58
msgid "The model in 0.2.0"
msgstr "0.2.0 的模型"

#: manual/design/core.md:60
msgid "0.2.0 measures columns instead of length, with these decisions (details and the rejected alternatives are recorded in #5):"
msgstr "0.2.0 改为度量列而不是长度，决定如下（细节和被否决的方案记录在 #5 中）："

#: manual/design/core.md:63
msgid "**Positions.** Arrays use element indices; strings use Unicode scalar indices. Every span is snapped outward to extended grapheme cluster boundaries (UAX #29). Snapping is a closure operator on spans ordered by inclusion: if $\\sigma$ snaps a span, then $S \\subseteq \\sigma(S)$, $S \\subseteq T \\Rightarrow \\sigma(S) \\subseteq \\sigma(T)$ and $\\sigma(\\sigma(S)) = \\sigma(S)$."
msgstr "**位置。** 数组用元素下标；字符串用 Unicode 标量下标。每个范围都向外对齐到扩展字形簇的边界（UAX #29）。对齐是范围在包含序上的闭包算子：若 $\\sigma$ 表示对齐，则 $S \\subseteq \\sigma(S)$，$S \\subseteq T \\Rightarrow \\sigma(S) \\subseteq \\sigma(T)$，且 $\\sigma(\\sigma(S)) = \\sigma(S)$。"

#: manual/design/core.md:69
msgid "**Columns.** Each grapheme cluster acts on the cursor $(\\ell, c)$: an ordinary cluster of width $w$ maps $c \\mapsto c + w$, a tab maps $c \\mapsto t(\\lfloor c/t \\rfloor + 1)$, and a newline maps $(\\ell, c) \\mapsto (\\ell + 1, 0)$. These moves form a monoid. Every composite is a shift, a tab move $c \\mapsto T(c + a) + b$ with $0 \\le a < t$, or a line break, because $T(T(x) + b) = T(x) + T(b)$. The marker column of a span is the move of its prefix applied to the origin."
msgstr "**列。** 每个字形簇作用在光标 $(\\ell, c)$ 上：宽度为 $w$ 的普通字形簇把 $c \\mapsto c + w$，Tab 把 $c \\mapsto t(\\lfloor c/t \\rfloor + 1)$，换行把 $(\\ell, c) \\mapsto (\\ell + 1, 0)$。这些移动构成一个幺半群。由于 $T(T(x) + b) = T(x) + T(b)$，任何复合都是一次平移、一次 Tab 移动 $c \\mapsto T(c + a) + b$（其中 $0 \\le a < t$）或一次换行。范围的标记列，就是其前缀对应的移动作用在原点上的结果。"

#: manual/design/core.md:76
msgid "**Widths** come from tables generated from the Unicode Character Database (Unicode 18.0.0), with East Asian Width (UAX #11) for wide characters."
msgstr "**宽度** 来自由 Unicode 字符数据库（Unicode 18.0.0）生成的表，宽字符按东亚宽度（UAX #11）判定。"

#: manual/design/core.md:78
msgid "**Several marks** overlay as a semilattice, so the output does not depend on the order in which marks are added."
msgstr "**多处标记** 的叠加构成一个半格，所以输出与添加标记的顺序无关。"

#: manual/design/core.md:80
msgid "**Elements are quoted** when needed, so the rendered line can always be split back into its elements."
msgstr "**元素在需要时加引号**，所以渲染出的行总能拆回各个元素。"

#: manual/index.md:1
msgid "err_marker"
msgstr "err_marker"

#: manual/index.md:5
msgid "This manual documents version `v0.1.3` of `KCN-judu/err_marker`."
msgstr "本手册对应 `KCN-judu/err_marker` 的 `v0.1.3` 版。"

#: manual/index.md:7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概览"

#: manual/index.md:9
msgid "`err_marker` shows a reader where an error is. It renders a sequence (the command-line arguments of a program, a list of tokens, or a string), draws a line of markers under the part that is wrong, and prints a message below:"
msgstr "`err_marker` 告诉读者错误在哪里。它渲染一个序列（程序的命令行参数、一串词法单元或一个字符串），在出错的部分下面画一行标记，再在下面输出一条信息："

#: manual/index.md:19
msgid "The library is one package with two types and four functions. It does not read files, track line numbers or colour its output; it turns a sequence, a position and a message into three lines of text."
msgstr "这个库只有一个包，包含两个类型和四个函数。它不读文件、不记行号、也不给输出上色；它只把一个序列、一个位置和一条信息变成三行文本。"

#: manual/index.md:23
msgid "The 0.1 series has known limits with non-ASCII text and newlines; they are listed in the [design](design/core.md) and tracked for 0.2.0 in [#5](https://github.com/moonbit-community/err_marker/issues/5)."
msgstr "0.1 系列在非 ASCII 文本和换行上有已知的局限；它们列在[设计](design/core.md)中，并在 [#5](https://github.com/moonbit-community/err_marker/issues/5) 中为 0.2.0 跟踪。"

#: manual/index.md:27
msgid "Install"
msgstr "安装"

#: manual/index.md:33
msgid "Then import `\"KCN-judu/err_marker\"` in your `moon.pkg`; the package is available as `@err_marker`. The module needs the MoonBit toolchain 0.10 or later (`moonc` ≥ 0.10) and depends only on `moonbitlang/core`."
msgstr "然后在你的 `moon.pkg` 中导入 `\"KCN-judu/err_marker\"`；包以 `@err_marker` 的名字可用。该模块需要 MoonBit 工具链 0.10 或更高版本（`moonc` ≥ 0.10），只依赖 `moonbitlang/core`。"

